{"4227410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just a Simple Turn-Based RPG", "steam_appid": 4227410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/4cbd834324f3c3ed8faa5af02b02b81f.avif?t=1772504734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras_big/4cbd834324f3c3ed8faa5af02b02b81f.avif?t=1772504734 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based RPG made for players who no longer have time (or patience) for endless grinding or for trying to understand overcomplicated plots about a group of students trying to save their rural city from a evil multiversal being.<br><br>You’re just an adventurer looking for treasure. No twists. No world-ending stakes. That’s it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/cb019922692f8b2e67926d7b03432878.poster.avif?t=1772504734\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/cb019922692f8b2e67926d7b03432878.webm?t=1772504734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/cb019922692f8b2e67926d7b03432878.mp4?t=1772504734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics</strong>, just like the good old days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short adventure</strong>, because your treasure isn’t always waiting in the next castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every turn matters:</strong> you control only one character, so every action counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast spells through enchantments:</strong> miss the input and… well, something <i>will</i> happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos:</strong> create your combo sequences but pay attention to dont miss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry:</strong> You can parry special attacks but you got only one chance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/76d29328ba3991dc6160548d6e7f7290.poster.avif?t=1772504734\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/76d29328ba3991dc6160548d6e7f7290.webm?t=1772504734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/76d29328ba3991dc6160548d6e7f7290.mp4?t=1772504734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the day… This is<strong> Just a Simple Turn-Based RPG</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/4cbd834324f3c3ed8faa5af02b02b81f.avif?t=1772504734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras_big/4cbd834324f3c3ed8faa5af02b02b81f.avif?t=1772504734 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based RPG made for players who no longer have time (or patience) for endless grinding or for trying to understand overcomplicated plots about a group of students trying to save their rural city from a evil multiversal being.<br><br>You’re just an adventurer looking for treasure. No twists. No world-ending stakes. That’s it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/cb019922692f8b2e67926d7b03432878.poster.avif?t=1772504734\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/cb019922692f8b2e67926d7b03432878.webm?t=1772504734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/cb019922692f8b2e67926d7b03432878.mp4?t=1772504734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics</strong>, just like the good old days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short adventure</strong>, because your treasure isn’t always waiting in the next castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every turn matters:</strong> you control only one character, so every action counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast spells through enchantments:</strong> miss the input and… well, something <i>will</i> happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos:</strong> create your combo sequences but pay attention to dont miss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry:</strong> You can parry special attacks but you got only one chance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/76d29328ba3991dc6160548d6e7f7290.poster.avif?t=1772504734\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227410/extras/7